{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trick or Treat Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies to fill up your fright meter. Use your fright power to scare enemies into dropping their candy or use for special frightening attacks.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parry With Your  Candy </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot colorful jawbreaker candy before an enemy attack to parry. Follow up with an attack to deal bonus damage. Candy has never been so deadly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Light and Heavy Attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your trusty double cleaver in stylized light and heavy attack combos to weaken your foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform swift dodges and dashes to avoid enemy attacks. Manage your speed and distance from the enemy to land attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382940?t=1759652092","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382940?t=1759652092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382940/12c8f090c81b729586307f00e96d9db2b52d2950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759652092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382940/12c8f090c81b729586307f00e96d9db2b52d2950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759652092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trick or Treat Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies to fill up your fright meter. Use your fright power to scare enemies into dropping their candy or use for special frightening attacks.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parry With Your  Candy </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot colorful jawbreaker candy before an enemy attack to parry. Follow up with an attack to deal bonus damage. Candy has never been so deadly!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Light and Heavy Attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your trusty double cleaver in stylized light and heavy attack combos to weaken your foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform swift dodges and dashes to avoid enemy attacks. Manage your speed and distance from the enemy to land attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Keyframed Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382940/1542678cdad6c530cf1fbb35856d288cd0b89a75/header.jpg?t=1759652092","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Trickington Hollow","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-7600k Processor / AMD Ryzen\u2122 5 1600X Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Keyframed Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382940/74b0a15e61e134e4186e668e50a88e3c8